WEBVTT

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:03.116
an attempt at converging life
into a human-sized space

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:08.566
rather than fracturing it
into inhuman bigness

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.886
and then forcing us to adapt.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:15.262
I call it "the 15-minute city."

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.586
And in a nutshell,

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:23.184
the idea is that cities
should be designed or redesigned

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:28.526
so that within the distance
of a 15-minute walk

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.216
or bike ride,